# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:（股票、外匯等投資）虧損時賣出或停止持有，俾少少錢，避免再蝕更多（量詞：個）
eng:to cut one's losses; to stop a loss by selling an asset
<eg>
yue:呢隻股票跌咁多，不如止蝕先啦。 (nei5 zi1 gu6 dao2 dik1 do1, bat1 yu4 zi2 sik1 sin1 laa1.)
eng:That stock has fallen so much; better to cut your losses now.

yue:我哋買咗之後就止蝕走人。 (ngo5 dei6 maai5 zau2 zi6 hoi6 jau5 zi2 sik1 zau2 jan4.)
eng:We bought it and then cut our losses and left. [end of text]


